<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PGM in continuing Competition Board talks.</title>
<headline>PGM in continuing Competition Board talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PGM Investments Ltd, the holding company of Vansa Vanadium SA Ltd, said on Thursday it was still involved in discussions to which the Competition Board was party and which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings but gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
